\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Precision-Recall (PR) curves on the binary detection task. Given the extreme class imbalance (0.86\% benign), PR curves provide a more honest assessment of false alarm rates than ROC curves. XAI-SDN maintains perfect precision even at maximum recall.}}{7}{figure.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pr}{{9}{7}{Precision-Recall (PR) curves on the binary detection task. Given the extreme class imbalance (0.86\% benign), PR curves provide a more honest assessment of false alarm rates than ROC curves. XAI-SDN maintains perfect precision even at maximum recall}{figure.9}{}}
